{"id":"difi_cil","lemma":"difícil","pos":"adj","rank":291,"glosses":["difficult, hard, tough, challenging, rough, tricky, trying, arduous, testing","unlikely (i.e. improbable)","awkward (e.g. situation or position)"],"ipa":"/diˈfiθil/","forms":{"femininePlural":"difíciles"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/90/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-dif%C3%ADcil.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Cuál es el más difícil según tú?","en":"Which is hardest in your opinion?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/826108","words":[{"g":"which one, what, which"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"more"},null,{"g":"according to"},{"g":"you"}]},{"text":"No hagas preguntas tan difíciles.","en":"Don't ask such hard questions.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/38411","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"question","l":"pregunta"},{"g":"so, as"},null]},{"text":"¿Es eso tan difícil de hacer?","en":"Is that so hard to do?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/455293","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"that","l":"ése"},{"g":"so, as"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to do"}]},{"text":"¿Fue una decisión difícil?","en":"Was it a hard decision?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460945","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"decision"},null]},{"text":"Estamos viviendo tiempos difíciles.","en":"These are tough times.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to live","l":"vivir"},{"g":"time","l":"tiempo"},null]}]}